 citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Turner</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayden</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Kiselica</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Association of group c beta-hemolytic streptococci with endemic pharyngitis among college students</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>1990</year><volume>264</volume><issue>20</issue><fpage>2644</fpage><lpage>2647</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.264.20.2644</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Turner J, Hayden G, Kiselica D. Association of group c beta-hemolytic streptococci with endemic pharyngitis among college students. JAMA. 1990;264(20):2644&#x02013;7. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2232040</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR30"><label>30.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gerber</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanz</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kabat</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Optical immunoassay test for group A B-hemolytic streptococcal pharyngitis&#x02014;an office-based, multicenter investigation</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>1997</year><volume>277</volume><issue>11</issue><fpage>899</fpage><lpage>903</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.277.11.899</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Gerber M, Tanz R, Kabat W. Optical immunoassay test for group A B-hemolytic streptococcal pharyngitis&#x02014;an office-based, multicenter investigation. JAMA. 1997;277(11):899&#x02013;903. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9062328</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn><p>We acknowledge that the designation severe pharyngitis is somewhat arbitrary. We have used the designation previously.<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="CR15">15<